{"id":"811f42d3d6662f09","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-pda-cfl-characterization.md","title":"73-thm-pda-cfl-characterization — pda cfl characterization","display":"73-thm-pda-cfl-characterization — pda cfl characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-pda-cfl-characterization","display":"73-thm-pda-cfl-characterization — pda cfl characterization","depends_on":["[[73-df-pda-notation]]","[[73-df-pda-acceptance-notations]]","[[73-df-cfl-notation]]","[[73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"aliases":["73-thm-pda-cfl-characterization","73-theorem-3.1"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-pda-cfl-characterization"},{"key":"display","html":"73-thm-pda-cfl-characterization — pda cfl characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a436382200a93b34\" href=\"?note=a436382200a93b34\" title=\"73-df-pda-notation\">73-df-pda-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"78740429e7dc7250\" href=\"?note=78740429e7dc7250\" title=\"73-df-pda-acceptance-notations\">73-df-pda-acceptance-notations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"351f87e03faac193\" href=\"?note=351f87e03faac193\" title=\"73-df-cfl-notation\">73-df-cfl-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"33e207bac16abe1a\" href=\"?note=33e207bac16abe1a\" title=\"73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence\">73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-pda-cfl-characterization</span><span>73-theorem-3.1</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PDA},L(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{PDA},L(M)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a436382200a93b34\" href=\"?note=a436382200a93b34\" title=\"73-df-pda-notation\">73-df-pda-notation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"78740429e7dc7250\" href=\"?note=78740429e7dc7250\" title=\"73-df-pda-acceptance-notations\">73-df-pda-acceptance-notations</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CFL}\">\\(\\mathrm{CFL}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"351f87e03faac193\" href=\"?note=351f87e03faac193\" title=\"73-df-cfl-notation\">73-df-cfl-notation</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{PDA}\\;L=L(M)\\}=\\mathrm{CFL}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\n\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*:\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{PDA}\\;L=L(M)\\}=\\mathrm{CFL}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;(L\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{PDA}\\;L=L(M))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}3.1}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;(L\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\leftrightarrow\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{PDA}\\;L=L(M))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-pda-notation","status":"resolved","id":"a436382200a93b34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-acceptance-notations","status":"resolved","id":"78740429e7dc7250","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-acceptance-notations]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfl-notation","status":"resolved","id":"351f87e03faac193","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfl-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"33e207bac16abe1a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-notation","statu